# ─── What to KEEP (explicit) ──────────────────────────────────
!*.qpf        # Project file
!*.qsf        # Settings / pin assignments
!*.v          # Verilog source
!*.vhd        # VHDL source
!*.sdc        # Timing constraints
!*.qsys       # Platform Designer system
!*.tcl        # Tcl scripts